I see how they need to be separate, but I wonder if it could be a separate argument that can be put to the right prop in the tests instead of here, something more like:

```suggestion
        translations: {
          showMoreButtonText({ isShowingMore, showMoreCount }) {
            return !isShowingMore
              ? `Show ${showMoreCount} more`
              : 'Show top items';
          },
        },
```

Which then gets mapped to the relevant translations / templates / slots in the setup file so that the test stays more generic (and hopefully later less mapping would be needed)

